            {"speaker": "月美", "chinese": "昨天明華給我們的那種水果，紅色的，叫什麼？", "pinyin": "Zuótiān Mínghuá gěi wǒmen de nà zhǒng shuǐguǒ, hóngsè de, jiào shénme?", "english": "What is that fruit, the red one, that Minghua gave us yesterday called?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "妳說的是西瓜吧？", "pinyin": "Nǐ shuō de shì xīguā ba?", "english": "I think you mean the watermelon."},
