            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "我以前不喜歡吃水果，現在很喜歡了。", "pinyin": "Wǒ yǐqián bù xǐhuān chī shuǐguǒ, xiànzài hěn xǐhuān le.", "english": "In the past, I didn't like to eat fruit, but now, I like it very much."},
            {"speaker": "月美", "chinese": "越南的水果也很好吃。", "pinyin": "Yuènán de shuǐguǒ yě hěn hǎochī.", "english": "Fruit in Vietnam is very good, too."},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "要是有機會，我想吃吃看。", "pinyin": "Yàoshi yǒu jīhuì, wǒ xiǎng chīchīkàn.", "english": "If I get the opportunity, I'd like to try it."},
