            {"speaker": "田中", "chinese": "很好玩。你看，這些是我拍的照片。", "pinyin": "Hěn hǎowán. Nǐ kàn, zhèxiē shì wǒ pāi de zhàopiàn.", "english": "Yes. Look. I took these pictures."},
