            {"speaker": "明華", "chinese": "她們兩個都很漂亮。這兩個男的是誰？", "pinyin": "Tāmen liǎng ge dōu hěn piàoliàng. Zhè liǎng ge nán de shì shéi?", "english": "They are both pretty. Who are these two men?"},
