            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "林先生，你好，我是白如玉，來看房子。", "pinyin": "Lín xiānshēng, nǐ hǎo, wǒ shì Bái Rúyù, lái kàn fángzi.", "english": "Hi, Mr. Lin. I am Bai Ruyu. I'm here to look at the house."},
