            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "這裡是客廳，廚房在左邊，右邊有浴室。", "pinyin": "Zhèlǐ shì kètīng, chúfáng zài zuǒbiān, yòubiān yǒu yùshì.", "english": "This is the living room. The kitchen is to the left. The bathroom is to the right."},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "房子很不錯。", "pinyin": "Fángzi hěn búcuò.", "english": "The place is nice."},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "這裡很方便，附近有超市和捷運站，走路五分鐘就到了。", "pinyin": "Zhèlǐ hěn fāngbiàn, fùjìn yǒu chāoshì hàn jiéyùn zhàn, zǒulù wǔ fēnzhōng jiù dào le.", "english": "It is conveniently located. Nearby, there are a supermarket and an MRT station. Walk five minutes and you're there."},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "現在有人住嗎？", "pinyin": "Xiànzài yǒu rén zhù ma?", "english": "Does anyone live here now?"},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "有。還有兩間空房間，一間是套房，一間不是。", "pinyin": "Yǒu. Hái yǒu liǎng jiān kōng fángjiān, yī jiān shì tàofáng, yī jiān bú shì.", "english": "Yes. There are still two vacant rooms. One is a suite (a room with a bath) and the other one is not."},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "我想看套房。房間裡面可以上網嗎？", "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng kàn tàofáng. Fángjiān lǐmiàn kěyǐ shàngwǎng ma?", "english": "I'd like to take a look at the suite. Can you access the internet from the room?"},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "可以。妳覺得這間房間怎麼樣？妳想租嗎？", "pinyin": "Kěyǐ. Nǐ juéde zhè jiān fángjiān zěnmeyàng? Nǐ xiǎng zū ma?", "english": "Yes. What do you think of this room? Do you want to rent it?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "我回去想想，再打電話給你。", "pinyin": "Wǒ huíqù xiǎngxiǎng, zài dǎ diànhuà gěi nǐ.", "english": "Let me go back and think it over. I'll call you."}
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogue": 2,
          "audio_ref": "11-3",
          "lines": [
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "喂，房東先生，你好，我是白如玉，你收到我的房租了嗎？", "pinyin": "Wèi, fángdōng xiānshēng, nǐ hǎo, wǒ shì Bái Rúyù, nǐ shōudào wǒ de fángzū le ma?", "english": "Hello, Mr. Landlord. This is Bai Ruyu. Have you received my rent?"},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "我已經收到了，謝謝。妳習慣了嗎？", "pinyin": "Wǒ yǐjīng shōudào le, xièxie. Nǐ xíguàn le ma?", "english": "I have received it. Thank you. Are you accustomed (to living there)?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "習慣了。可是，有一個問題，熱水器的水好像不熱。", "pinyin": "Xíguàn le. Kěshì, yǒu yī ge wèntí, rèshuǐqì de shuǐ hǎoxiàng bù rè.", "english": "Yes. But there is a problem. The water from the water heater doesn't seem to be hot."},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "今天我會去看看。妳什麼時候有空？晚上可以嗎？", "pinyin": "Jīntiān wǒ huì qù kànkàn. Nǐ shénme shíhòu yǒu kòng? Wǎnshàng kěyǐ ma?", "english": "I will go check it out today. When are you free? Would tonight be okay?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "不好意思，今天晚上我有事。", "pinyin": "Bù hǎoyìsi, jīntiān wǎnshàng wǒ yǒu shì.", "english": "I am sorry. I've got something to do this evening."},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "沒關係，明天下午呢？", "pinyin": "Méi guānxi, míngtiān xiàwǔ ne?", "english": "That is alright. How about tomorrow afternoon?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "好，我在家等你。", "pinyin": "Hǎo, wǒ zài jiā děng nǐ.", "english": "Okay. I will wait for you at home."},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "那我明天下午兩點到。還有問題嗎？", "pinyin": "Nà wǒ míngtiān xiàwǔ liǎng diǎn dào. Hái yǒu wèntí ma?", "english": "I will be there at two. Are there any other problems?"},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "我想買電視。請問可以幫我裝有線電視嗎？", "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng mǎi diànshì. Qǐngwèn kěyǐ bāng wǒ zhuāng yǒuxiàn diànshì ma?", "english": "I want to buy a television. Could I trouble you to put in cable for me?"},
            {"speaker": "房東", "chinese": "可以，不過妳得自己付錢。", "pinyin": "Kěyǐ, búguò nǐ děi zìjǐ fùqián.", "english": "Yes, but you will have to pay for it yourself."},
            {"speaker": "如玉", "chinese": "好的，謝謝你。", "pinyin": "Hǎode, xièxie nǐ.", "english": "Fine. Thank you."}
          ]
        }
      ]
