            {"speaker": "安同", "chinese": "我先在語言中心念一年，再念四年大學，所以需要五年。", "pinyin": "Wǒ xiān zài yǔyán zhōngxīn niàn yī nián, zài niàn sì nián dàxué, suǒyǐ xūyào wǔ nián.", "english": "I am going to study for a year at the language center, then study at university for four years, so I need five years."},
