            {"speaker": "田中", "chinese": "我又要上班，又要念書，真的很累。", "pinyin": "Wǒ yòu yào shàngbān, yòu yào niànshū, zhēnde hěn lèi.", "english": "I have to both work and study. It is exhausting."},
            {"speaker": "安同", "chinese": "我們一起加油吧！", "pinyin": "Wǒmen yīqǐ jiāyóu ba!", "english": "Let's keep up the good work."}
